	'k15bf4ac2' => 'Café Noor is a neighbourhood dining room seating 28 guests. The challenge was to deliver enough light for dining and reading menus while preserving a warm, calm evening ambience throughout the room. We hung four Low Pendant Trios (€760 each) across the dining floor, positioned between 65 and 75 cm above the oak dining tables. Each fixture\'s three 18 cm smoked-glass pendants soften bulb brightness while focusing warm 2700K light cleanly onto tabletops. The arrangement maintains clear eye lines between seated patrons while lending privacy to every table.',
	'k15e980e5' => 'Bay Floor Lamp',
	'k160979ee' => 'Sam Okoro',
	'k161192fb' => 'We keep exactly six pieces on display each month, resting on low stone plinths in a dim, quiet room. The floor is re-set on the first Wednesday of each month, presenting fixtures calibrated to 2700K warm white. When visiting to plan a room, showroom manager Adaeze Mensah recommends bringing photographs of your space, a simple dimensioned floor plan, and your ceiling height. These details allow lighting planner Tomasz Rehn to assess sightlines, calculate suspension heights, and recommend pieces tailored to your room\'s daily routine.',
	'k16990ea1' => 'Shade maker',
	'k16d25318' => 'You may select up to three pieces from our current showroom floor to borrow for seven days with a refundable deposit of €50. This trial lets you observe how the fixtures illuminate your actual walls, furniture, and finishes once night falls. If you decide to keep a piece, your €50 deposit is credited directly to your order total. If the lamps do not suit your space, simply return them to Steenkade 14 within the seven-day period for a full refund.',
	'k17340583' => 'Physical installation is carried out by our partner electrician, Joris van Dalen, starting from €85 per fitting. Joris handles ceiling pendant suspensions, wall sconce bracket mounting, cable routing, and compatible dimmer integration. Having our partner electrician complete the work ensures every piece is safely secured, aligned with your light plan, and adjusted to the correct hanging height.',
