	'k1f233f49' => 'For broader architectural projects, we produce comprehensive written light plans covering fixture placements, dimmer circuits, and 2700K bulb assignments. We charge €480 for residential plans covering up to 6 rooms, and €650 for small dining rooms or cafés of up to 40 seats. Our partner electrician Joris van Dalen provides on-site installation starting from €85 per fitting, while Sam Okoro carries out vintage lamp rewiring at our workshop bench from €65. Please include any relevant architectural sketches or ceiling dimensions when writing to us.',
