	'k21602c58' => '[ 03 ] Rooms',
	'k22023dfa' => 'To arrange an appointment with lighting planner Tomasz Rehn or showroom manager Adaeze Mensah, please provide your name, e-mail address, preferred date, and the type of room you wish to discuss. A 45-minute showroom visit is free of charge. If you would like us to visit your home in the Rotterdam area, our 90-minute home consultation is priced at €120. We can also arrange a 7-day home trial of up to three showroom pieces with a €50 refundable deposit, giving you time to observe how the fixtures illuminate your space after dark.',
	'k2541cab3' => 'Yes. At our Steenkade 14 workshop, technician Sam Okoro undertakes the rewiring and repair of vintage lamps starting from €65. We disassemble aged fittings, inspect sockets, replace frayed wiring with new 2.5 m braided cords, install modern grounded European plugs, and ensure dimmer compatibility. We test every fixture on the bench before returning it to you, allowing cherished historic lighting to function safely with modern 2700K bulbs.',
