	'ka65b591d' => 'Every lamp in our collection is built by independent European workshops sharing our commitment to quiet materials and repairable fittings. Each piece is made to live with you for decades.',
	'ka81e74f3' => 'This room is still dark — This room is still dark — This room is still dark —',
